              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 4:6-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgenda arabacīra inzira yadūze imbere yabo: baramennye, baca mw irembo, barifyuka inyuma: umwami wabo yabagiye imbere, Uhoraho ni we yabarōngōra.",
          "type": "text",
